### Four M07 object classes

| Object class | Four checks per object |
| --- | --- |
| Quality goal | Applicable scale and environment, assessable target and units and basis, measurement method, and measurement data and evidence plan. |
| Security boundary | Component and identity trust boundary, permission and owner, credential and data flow and egress, and failure, revocation, and applicable deletion. |
